 },
 "summary": "A constant current source on one die, built as a PNP transistor with integrated resistors plus two diodes, in a 5-lead SOT353 (SC-88A) package. Left alone it sources about 15 µA from IOUT; a resistor from VS to REXT raises the current, anywhere from 15 µA up to 50 mA. It runs from supplies up to 75 V. Uses named for it are LED drivers, general current sources, active bias for audio amplifiers and automotive circuits.",
